ed}&\\int_{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}^{\\ln{\\left(3 \\right)}} \\frac{4 e^{x}}{e^{x} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=4\\left(\\int_{3}^{4} \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $e^{\\ln 2}=2,\\quad e^{\\ln 3}=3$.\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\ln\\left|u\\right|+C.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n4\\left(\\left[\\ln\\left|u\\right|\\right]_{3}^{4}\\right)=4\\left(\\left(\\ln{\\left(4 \\right)}\\right)-\\left(\\ln{\\left(3 \\right)}\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n4\\left(\\ln\\left(4\\right)-\\ln\\left(3\\right)\\right).\n$$"] [:db/add "2963665c-c27d-5066-9d24-fca8da38a3ed" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "2963665c-c27d-5066-9d24-fca8da38a3ed" :question/answer-fields "08caccc4-9c2f-58fb-8975-52cd7a1ff3a4"] [:db/ensure "2963665c-c27d-5066-9d24-fca8da38a3ed" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186184352 :knowledge-point/questions "2963665c-c27d-5066-9d24-fca8da38a3ed"] [:db/add "477bedff-d5ed-543d-a499-890302b02dc5" :answer/id #uuid "477bedff-d5ed-543d-a499-890302b02dc5"] [:db/add "477bedff-d5ed-543d-a499-890302b02dc5" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "477bedff-d5ed-543d-a499-890302b02dc5" :answer/value "3\\left(\\ln\\left(12\\right)-\\ln\\left(9\\right)\\right)"] [:db/ensure "477bedff-d5ed-543d-a499-890302b02dc5" :answer/validate] [:db/add "a9f990f1-50fc-5b77-b9f9-3a333bcded2f" :answer-field/id #uuid "a9f990f1-50fc-5b77-b9f9-3a333bcded2f"] [:db/add "a9f990f1-50fc-5b77-b9f9-3a333bcded2f" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "a9f990f1-50fc-5b77-b9f9-3a333bcded2f" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "a9f990f1-50fc-5b77-b9f9-3a333bcded2f" :answer-field/choices "477bedff-d5ed-543d-a499-890302b02dc5"] [:db/add "a9f990f1-50fc-5b77-b9f9-3a333bcded2f" :answer-field/correct "477bedff-d5ed-543d-a499-890302b02dc5"] [:db/ensure "a9f990f1-50fc-5b77-b9f9-3a333bcded2f" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "90c498cb-